  {
   "section": "why-sciex-applications",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Why SCIEX for your application"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "SCIEX Applications"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "SCIEX mass spec and capillary electrophoresis solutions are designed by scientists with your applications in mind. From routine testing to the most complex analytical experiments, we constantly innovate to enable you to transform your workflows."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "https://sciex.com/applications"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Clinical Diagnostics"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Improve the quality of results, achieve faster turnaround times, and reduce costs. Routine diagnostic testing that delivers excellent accuracy and robust performance with our in vitro diagnostic medical device mass spectrometers"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "https://sciex.com/diagnostics"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Environmental Testing"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "Overcome complex matrices and measure more compounds in every sample. Our solutions deliver the lowest possible detection limits at trace levels with the ultimate accuracy."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "https://sciex.com/applications/environmental-testing"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 10,
     "text": "Food and Beverage Testing"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 11,
     "text": "Meet maximum residue limits (MRLs) with high-quality data that you can genuinely count upon. With SCIEX your lab can quickly and easily react to diverse market needs."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 12,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "https://sciex.com/applications/food-and-beverage-testing"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 13,
     "text": "Forensics Analysis"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 14,
     "text": "Accurately detect even the smallest compounds to deliver evidence that stands. Get fast, highly accurate data across a multitude of compounds and biomarkers."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 15,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "https://sciex.com/applications/forensics-testing"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 16,
     "text": "Life Science Research"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 17,
     "text": "Capture the best data, integrate results cross-omics, and gain relevant insights to make your next discovery. Get more reliable information on the key genes, proteins, lipids, and metabolites for your research."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 18,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "https://sciex.com/applications/life-science-research"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 19,
     "text": "Pharma and BioPharma Research"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 20,
     "text": "Transform the capacity and capability of your biologics pipeline with innovative end-to-end mass spec and capillary electrophoresis solutions that help you to make better development decisions, faster."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 21,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "https://sciex.com/applications/pharma-and-biopharma"
    }
